{"file":"battle/DevilMsg/dMsg_Beast.txt","id":"24","source":"(Mido) [7a 1]...It seems there was an error in\nyour fusion. A different demon than\nthe planned result has been created.\n[->][END]","translation":"(Мидо) [7a 1]...Похоже, при слиянии произошла ошибка.\nВ результате появился демон, отличный от\nзапланированного.\n[->][END]","status":"translated"}
{"file":"battle/DevilMsg/dMsg_Boss01.txt","id":"0","source":"[71 1]Samurai... You must master this\nnew power.\n[->][END]","translation":"[71 1]Самурай... Ты должен овладеть этой\nновой силой.\n[->][END]","status":"translated"}
{"file":"battle/DevilMsg/dMsg_Boss01.txt","id":"1","source":"[71 1]Samurai... You must master this\nnew power.\n[->][END]","translation":"[71 1]Самурай... Ты должен овладеть этой\nновой силой.\n[->][END]","status":"translated"}
{"file":"battle/DevilMsg/dMsg_Boss01.txt","id":"2","source":"[71 1]Samurai... You must master this\nnew power.\n[->][END]","translation":"[71 1]Самурай... Ты должен овладеть этой\nновой силой.\n[->][END]","status":"translated"}
{"file":"battle/DevilMsg/dMsg_Boss01.txt","id":"3","source":"[71 1]This is the true power of a demon...\nFollow me, Samurai!\n[->][END]","translation":"[71 1]Такова истинная сила демона...\nСледуй за мной, Самурай!\n[->][END]","status":"translated"}
{"file":"battle/DevilMsg/dMsg_Boss01.txt","id":"4","source":"[71 1]I cannot hold any more skills. If you\nwish me to gain a new one, then you\nmust choose one to discard...\n[->][END]","translation":"[71 1]Я больше не могу изучать навыки. Если\nты хочешь, чтобы я получил новый, тебе\nпридётся выбрать один для удаления...\n[->][END]","status":"translated"}
{"file":"battle/DevilMsg/dMsg_Boss01.txt","id":"5","source":"[71 1]My [Color:0x5][Skill 1][Color:0x0] shall be changed\nto [Color:0x5][Skill 2]...[Color:0x0]\n[->][END]","translation":"[71 1]Мой [Color:0x5][Skill 1][Color:0x0] будет заменён\nна [Color:0x5][Skill 2]...[Color:0x0]\n[->][END]","status":"translated"}
{"file":"battle/DevilMsg/dMsg_Boss01.txt","id":"6","source":"[71 1]My [Color:0x5][Skill 1][Color:0x0] shall be changed\ninto a dreadful skill...\n[->][END]","translation":"[71 1]Мой [Color:0x5][Skill 1][Color:0x0] превратится\nв ужасный навык...\n[->][END]","status":"translated"}
{"file":"battle/DevilMsg/dMsg_Boss01.txt","id":"7","source":"[71 1]Now there is the Samurai spirit!\n[->][END]","translation":"[71 1]Вот это дух Самурая!\n[->][END]","status":"translated"}
{"file":"battle/DevilMsg/dMsg_Boss01.txt","id":"8","source":"[71 1]Hmm... That is one way to proceed.\n[->][END]","translation":"[71 1]Хм... Это тоже один из вариантов.\n[->][END]","status":"translated"}
{"file":"battle/DevilMsg/dMsg_Boss01.txt","id":"9","source":"[71 1]Tremble in fear at this\n[Color:0x5][Skill 1]...[Color:0x0]\n[->][END]","translation":"[71 1]Трепещи от страха перед этим\n[Color:0x5][Skill 1]...[Color:0x0]\n[->][END]","status":"translated"}
{"file":"battle/DevilMsg/dMsg_Boss01.txt","id":"15","source":"[71 1]This [Color:0x5][Item 1][Color:0x0] is for you.\nMake good use of it, Samurai.\n[->][END]","translation":"[71 1]Это [Color:0x5][Item 1][Color:0x0] для тебя.\nИспользуй его с пользой, Самурай.\n[->][END]","status":"translated"}
{"file":"battle/DevilMsg/dMsg_Boss01.txt","id":"16","source":"[71 1]Well fought as usual, Samurai.\nTake this [Color:0x5][Item 1]...[Color:0x0]\n[->][END]","translation":"[71 1]Как всегда, достойный бой, Самурай.\nВозьми это: [Color:0x5][Item 1]...[Color:0x0]\n[->][END]","status":"translated"}
{"file":"battle/DevilMsg/dMsg_Boss01.txt","id":"17","source":"[71 1]I shall give you this [Color:0x5][Item 1]...[Color:0x0]\nIt is a mere token of my gratitude.\n[->][END]","translation":"[71 1]Я отдам тебе это: [Color:0x5][Item 1]...[Color:0x0]\nЭто лишь небольшой знак моей благодарности.\n[->][END]","status":"translated"}
{"file":"battle/DevilMsg/dMsg_Boss01.txt","id":"18","source":"[71 1]Samurai! The time has come for me to\nteach you the secrets of my strength.\n[->][END]","translation":"[71 1]Самурай! Пришло время открыть тебе\nсекреты моей силы.\n[->][END]","status":"translated"}
{"file":"battle/DevilMsg/dMsg_Boss01.txt","id":"19","source":"[71 1]Have you learned the secrets of my\nstrength to your heart's content?\n[->][END]","translation":"[71 1]Ты узнал секреты моей силы в полной\nмере?\n[->][END]","status":"translated"}
{"file":"battle/DevilMsg/dMsg_Boss01.txt","id":"20","source":"[71 1]In honor of my pact with old Aquila,\nI shall form a new one here...\n[->]I am [Color:0x5][Demon race 1] [Demon name 1]...[Color:0x0]\nThis soul will be with you, Samurai...\n[->][END]","translation":"[71 1]В честь моего договора со старым Аквилой\nя заключу здесь новый...\n[->]Я — [Color:0x5][Demon race 1] [Demon name 1]...[Color:0x0]\nЭта душа будет с тобой, Самурай...\n[->][END]","status":"translated"}
{"file":"battle/DevilMsg/dMsg_Boss01.txt","id":"21","source":"[71 1]Let the skill mutate\nDon't let it change\n[->][END]","translation":"[71 1]Позволить навыку мутировать\nНе менять его\n[->][END]","status":"translated"}
{"file":"battle/DevilMsg/dMsg_Boss01.txt","id":"22","source":"Allow the demon to transform\nDon't do it\n[->][END]","translation":"Позволить демону превратиться\nНе делать этого\n[->][END]","status":"translated"}
{"file":"battle/DevilMsg/dMsg_Boss01.txt","id":"23","source":"”I'm satisfied.”\n”Let me think...”\n[->][END]","translation":"«Я доволен.»\n«Дайте подумать...»\n[->][END]","status":"translated"}
{"file":"battle/DevilMsg/dMsg_Boss01.txt","id":"24","source":"(Mido) [7a 1]...It seems there was an error in\nyour fusion. A different demon than\nthe planned result has been created.\n[->][END]","translation":"(Мидо) [7a 1]...Похоже, при слиянии произошла ошибка.\nВ результате появился демон, отличный от\nзапланированного.\n[->][END]","status":"translated"}
